# Small integer certificates for the integral reference word

These tables are derived from John Bray's ATLAS 6L34G1-Ar6aB0 and Gerald
Höhn's icosian coordinates, revision 8eabb35afe2b5e45bf913a2d05c53e558d2e2917.
They retain the ATLAS Research and Attribution License 1.0; see LICENSES/ATLAS.txt
and LICENSES/ATLAS-CITATION.cff. No isometry or conjugacy follows from data alone.

In block coordinates, the generator indices are xLift, yLift, generatorA,
and generatorB. Every generator and each prefix of the eight-factor word has
denominator two. The icosian-coordinate actions have denominator four.
The integer products are checked separately before transport to actual isometries.
-/

